 R←Test_SendEmail_58(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;connection;rc;msg;log
⍝ A server that does not answer: `Do` gives up after three attempts of two seconds each, so this takes 6 seconds.
⍝ The connection is then forgotten, and the next `Send` connects again.
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 ∆SERVER.Clear
 connection←⎕NEW SMTP.Connection(,⊂∆NewParms)
 (rc msg)←connection.Logon
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 ∆SERVER.Ignore←,⊂'noop'
 (rc msg)←connection.Ping
 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 →T.PassesIf 1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'555 Conga timeout'≡msg
 →T.PassesIf~⊃connection.Connected
 →T.PassesIf~connection.LoggedOn
 (rc msg log)←connection.Send ∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢∆SERVER.Messages

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
